python/venv

data

# Secrets and local state. Dockerfile.dev copies the whole context into the image, so anything
# not listed here ends up in a layer: the adb key the Android phones trust, the HTTPS private key,
# the config that points at it, per-device stream settings and logs.
adbkeys
certs
config.https.yaml
stream-config.json
logs
# Agent worktrees and session files: whole copies of the checkout.
.claude
